    "detailed_description": "<strong>Game System</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meteorite</h2>.The purple stone is a meteorite and approaches the player.<br>If the star itself hits this, it will be a miss.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Volcano stars</h2>.Initially, the volcano star is the character to be controlled.<br>When the meteorite is approaching, use the [W][A][D] keys to rotate the star,<br>lava against the meteorite to destroy it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Score</h2>.In this game, you can earn a score by destroying meteorites.<br>At a certain timing when you get a score, the speed of the meteorite will increase.<br>Destroy meteorites before you miss to earn score.<br>You can change the appearance of the meteorite when you get a score.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Game System</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meteorite</h2>.The purple stone is a meteorite and approaches the player.<br>If the star itself hits this, it will be a miss.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Volcano stars</h2>.Initially, the volcano star is the character to be controlled.<br>When the meteorite is approaching, use the [W][A][D] keys to rotate the star,<br>lava against the meteorite to destroy it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Score</h2>.In this game, you can earn a score by destroying meteorites.<br>At a certain timing when you get a score, the speed of the meteorite will increase.<br>Destroy meteorites before you miss to earn score.<br>You can change the appearance of the meteorite when you get a score.",
    "short_description": "This game is a score attack type game where you rotate the volcano star with the [W][A][D] keys and destroy the meteorite with the lava part to earn a score.If a non-volcanic part of the star hits the meteorite, it will be a miss. Earn a score before you miss.",
